Audit complete: **FAIL / NOT_LEGIT**.

The proof reconstructs and all 11 claims reach `#Top`, but they cover only fixed examples and bounded singleton lists—not arbitrary integer arrays. This materially narrows the HumanEval contract. Fresh body and false-result mutations also confirmed the bounded proof is non-vacuous.

